# DTx Backend — Environment Variables Template
# ────────────────────────────────────────────
# STEP 1: Copy this file:
#           cp backend/.env.example backend/.env          (macOS/Linux)
#           Copy-Item backend\.env.example backend\.env   (Windows PowerShell)
#
# STEP 2: Replace placeholder values with your real credentials.
#
# ⚠️  NEVER commit backend/.env to version control.
#     The .gitignore at the project root already excludes it.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic Claude API key
# Get yours at: https://console.anthropic.com/account/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Database connection
# Local dev (SQLite):
DTX_DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./dtx.db
# Production (PostgreSQL example):
# DTX_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dtx
